        0.70	-0.01471
        </tableData>
    </table>

    <!--
    Power Coefficient Table: C_P vs Advance Ratio (J)

    Power calculation: P = C_P * ρ * n³ * D⁵

    Target max power: 2685 W = 3.6 HP
