        </tableData>
    </table>

    <!--
    Static Performance Estimates (at sea level, standard atmosphere):

    Hover (J=0):
    - RPM: 6461 (measured from motor test data)
    - Thrust: 11.114 kg (24.5 lbs) per motor
    - Power: 2684.4 W per motor
